lisa-design:
The Graph tab has no event detail panel: clicking an event opens its Timeline row, so Replay lives there (one place) and the graph marks a replay's actions on their rule. Board cards carry no tasks (WorkItem only), so reasonDetail is shown on the LLM tasks tab, the run page (GET /tasks/{id} of the run's task, a Pending task with a reason) and the graph task's tooltip. Close, delete and replay are REST routes, not commands, so they use ConfirmRequest (shows the method, path and JSON body) instead of ConfirmCommand.
